        ],
        "expected": "the overloaded run(Strategy, TradeType, Num, int, int) receives Num amount equal to barSeries.one() (e.g., Num.valueOf(123.45)) and returns the TradingRecord supplied by that overload",
        "description": "Overrides the 5\u2011argument run method to capture the Num argument. The test builds a BarSeries whose one() returns a known Num (123.45). After invoking run(strategy, BUY, 2, 5) the captured amount must equal 123.45, proving that the delegating method forwards the correct amount."
      }
    ]
  },
